{"doc":"Order event schema v2 — adds optional promoCode. BACKWARD compatible with v1.","fields":[{"doc":"Business key — used for idempotent upserts","name":"orderId","type":"string"},{"name":"customerId","type":"string"},{"doc":"Order total in minor currency units","name":"amountCents","type":"long"},{"default":"USD","name":"currency","type":"string"},{"name":"itemCount","type":"int"},{"doc":"Epoch millis when the simulator produced the event; used for end-to-end latency measurement","name":"producedAt","type":"long"},{"default":"v2","name":"schemaVersion","type":"string"},{"default":null,"doc":"NEW in v2 — nullable with default so v1 records still read cleanly","name":"promoCode","type":["null","string"]}],"name":"OrderEvent","namespace":"dev.vishalbhardwaj.eventpulse.avro","type":"record"}